@startuml
title Audio feedback and microphone communication

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

object "processUiActions\n(application coroutine)" as Application
object "UiActionProcessor" as Processor
object "ControllerMessages" as Messages
object "AudioFeedback::service\n(audio coroutine)" as AudioTask
object ES8311
object "ESP-IDF I2S RX/TX" as I2s
object "playTone\n(child coroutine)" as Tone
object "updateLighting\n(lighting coroutine)" as LightingTask
object "LightingOutput" as Lighting
object MusicEnvelope

Application --> Processor : 1: process semantic action
Processor --> Messages : 1.1: request strongest pending AudioCue
Messages --> AudioTask : 2: takeAudio()
AudioTask --> Tone : 2.1: co_await playTone()
Tone --> I2s : 2.2: preload complete fixed tone
Tone --> I2s : 2.3: enable hardware-clocked playback
Tone --> Tone : 2.4: delay for exact tone duration
Tone --> I2s : 2.5: disable channel
Tone --> AudioTask : 2.6: completion

AudioTask --> ES8311 : 3: configure codec once
AudioTask --> I2s : 4: zero-timeout microphone read
AudioTask --> AudioTask : 4.1: publish latest amplitude mailbox
LightingTask --> Lighting : 5: apply music frame
Lighting --> AudioTask : 5.1: take latest amplitude
Lighting --> MusicEnvelope : 5.2: attack/release update

note bottom of Messages
  Feedback cues intentionally coalesce:
  Double outranks Single while one cue is pending.
end note

note bottom of AudioTask
  The audio coroutine exclusively owns ES8311
  and I2S. Old microphone samples are discarded.
end note
@enduml
